  "description": "Transform empty rooms into warm, cozy spaces in Cozy Home Unpacking - a relaxing organization and decoration simulator where every box hides a new story. Unpack furniture, place decorations, organize everyday items, and slowly turn simple apartments into beautiful homes filled with comfort and personality.\n\nTake your time as you decorate bedrooms, kitchens, living rooms, and tiny cozy corners exactly the way you want. Arrange books, plants, posters, kitchenware, toys, and dozens of charming objects while enjoying a calm atmosphere and satisfying gameplay.\n\nWith soft visuals, relaxing vibes, and stress-free gameplay, Cozy Home Unpacking is the perfect experience for players who love decorating, organizing, and creating peaceful spaces.",
